  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1202.07 Primary water operator",
  "priorExpiration": "2010-04-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1202.07 “Primary water operator” means an individual who is certified under Env-Dw 502 at a grade 1-A level or higher, who has been designated by the PORS O/O as being responsible for the operation of the PORS in accordance with Env-Dw 502.24.\n\nSource. #9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18",
